#: app/data/werner.data.ts#getConsultant
msgid ""
"I led development of the qooxdoo JavaScript UI framework at 1&1 and worked on "
"Deutsche Telekom's Unify framework and early Tolino browser software. Core and"
" Jasy were developed on our own initiative and used extensively at Zynga for "
"our games' base library and build process. Today, my infrastructure work also "
"includes Rust engines with TypeScript/Node.js interfaces."
msgstr ""
"I led development of the qooxdoo JavaScript UI framework at 1&1 and worked on "
"Deutsche Telekom's Unify framework and early Tolino browser software. Core and"
" Jasy were developed on our own initiative and used extensively at Zynga for "
