#: app/data/fastner.projects-featured.ts#getFeaturedProjects
msgid ""
"Vidal MMI, part of the VIDAL Group, publishes Gelbe Liste Online, a reference "
"portal on drugs, active ingredients, and manufacturers for physicians, "
"pharmacists, and other healthcare professionals. Before launch, its React "
"frontend had to be made production-ready, and I stepped in at short notice to "
"support the team.\n"
"\n"
"I took on work across the application: access rules based on professional "
"group and prescription status, search including the IDENTA drug "
"identification, product pages, and structured data and tracking for search "
"engines and advertising. Targeted regression tests and a shared TypeScript and"
" lint check secure these fixes."
msgstr ""
"Vidal MMI, part of the VIDAL Group, publishes Gelbe Liste Online, a reference "
"portal on drugs, active ingredients, and manufacturers for physicians, "
"pharmacists, and other healthcare professionals. Before launch, its React "
"frontend had to be made production-ready, and I stepped in at short notice to "
"support the team.\n"
"\n"
"I took on work across the application: access rules based on professional "
"group and prescription status, search including the IDENTA drug "
"identification, product pages, and structured data and tracking for search "
"engines and advertising. Targeted regression tests and a shared TypeScript and"
" lint check secure these fixes."

